v><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-305403 yct.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c6/Spine_static-305403_yct.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"195\" height=\"490\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"195\" data-file-height=\"490\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3054\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%8B%E8%91%B1%E5%A4%B4\" title=\"洋葱头\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%8B%E8%91%B1%E5%A4%B4\" title=\"洋葱头\"><img alt=\"洋葱头\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%8B%E8%91%B1%E5%A4%B4\" title=\"洋葱头\">洋葱头</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.9</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>多焦点舞台</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：305403</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“欢迎收看由《Headonion》特别呈现的克里特站人力飞行比赛现场播报！准备好呐喊与欢呼，让我们一起见证选手们飞向蓝天的时刻！”<br />星舰、渔船、充气恐龙，带着鸭子头套的记者穿梭在奇形怪状的自制飞行器之间进行报道。“线形流畅的B.Duck翼装、恰到好处的加速度……哇哦！恭喜Pinky选手夺冠！”<br />以娱乐的心态停留，却再也无法切换节目——比赛的历史、选手们的设计理念、每架飞行器的表现，甚至观众席上一位往届参赛者的名字，迅速，准确，她如数家珍。再挑剔的观众都必须承认，记者小姐是以绝对认真的态度为观众呈现这场赛事。说到底，谁来给新闻下个定义呢？她不相信太阳底下没有新鲜事，这世界上总有些趣事需要被人们知道，而她要做的就是——给它们一个镜头、一个声音、一个飞向天空时的见证。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"305403\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305404.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/Belonging-305404.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">夏日之声<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Voice of Summer</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />55<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一支专为中波广播设计的防水话筒，其上的泳圈并非装饰，经实测，它确实具有防沉海功能，落入海中后，传来的声音会随着海浪的起伏变得迷幻起来。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305405.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c6/Belonging-305405.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">万用工作服<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">All-Purpose Workwear</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />88<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一件Pinky限定签售款时尚外套，上面还别有三枚Pinky徽章。其外表采用微孔膜材料配合拉链设计，内里采用铜氨丝织就立体华夫格纹理，可以做到个性化控温。受访者十分建议大家入手，因为其不仅功能实用，价格也非常友好。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305406.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6e/Belonging-305406.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“花边体育”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Sideline Gossip\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>为采访人力飞行赛冠军Pinky，受访者在半小时内赶制出来的帅气B.Duck头套。其头部缀有可食用的椰子布丁——根据多位采访者贡献的统计数据，这样装扮自己更容易得到Pinky的“青睐”，且采访成功率高达99.99%。“Pinky和B.Duck疑似是情侣关系！”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 体育快讯1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 体育快讯2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2%E5%BF%AB%E8%AE%AF2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">体育快讯 <small style=\"color: grey\">Front Page Exclusive</small></span></span>"}}